\p \v 1 \w I hope|strong="G3785"\w* \w you will put up with|strong="G430"\w* \w a|strong="G5100"\w* \w little|strong="G3398"\w* \w of my|strong="G1473"\w* \w foolishness|strong="G877"\w*, \w but|strong="G235"\w* \w you are already doing that|strong="G430"\w*. \v 2 \w I am jealous for|strong="G2206"\w* \w you|strong="G4771"\w* \w with a godly|strong="G2316"\w* \w jealousy|strong="G2205"\w*. \w For|strong="G1063"\w* \w I promised|strong="G718"\w* \w you|strong="G4771"\w* \w to one|strong="G1520"\w* \w husband|strong="G435"\w*, \w to present you|strong="G3936"\w* \w as a pure|strong="G53"\w* \w virgin|strong="G3933"\w* \w to Christ|strong="G5547"\w*.
